  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to introduce and demonstrate 3D Construction Printing as a low-carbon reconstruction method in Lebanon. Project will test full construction technology, aiming to validate scalable business model for sustainable construction that in the long term creates local jobs and strengthens climate resilience.</narrative>
